[Event "Anderssen's Opening"]
[Key "anderssen"]
[Group "Irregular openings"]
[GroupOrder "1"]
[ECO "A00"]
[Side "white"]

1. a3 {A waiting move: White plays a reversed opening with the useful extra move a3.}
1... e5 (1... d5 2. d4 Nf6 3. Nf3 e6 4. Bf4 c5) (1... g6 2. c4 Bg7 3. Nc3 c5)
2. c4 {A Sicilian with colours reversed; a3 stops ...Bb4.} 2... Nf6 3. Nc3 d5
4. cxd5 Nxd5 5. e3 Nxc3 (5... Nb6 6. Nf3 Nc6) 6. bxc3 Bd6 *

